{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_08_end","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_08","title":"親族","storyCode":"SV-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"f7c558171635a89e91b107eba6633f54661b06f9d0674bf0b173f586cda47269","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"歌蕾蒂婭殺死了海嗣。主教憤怒地撲向深海獵人。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcave"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"海嗣的身體再一次被歌蕾蒂婭洞穿。\n海嗣將死。\n海嗣沒有把“臉”轉向主教。旁人也不可能知道海嗣是否長著眼睛，但斯卡蒂就是能感覺到怪物的視線——至少她自己這麼覺得。\n它正“看著”主教。\n無形的洋流正沖刷著主教，袍裙沉重地壓在他的身上，幾要把他摧垮。\n但海嗣正對她們說話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是更像我......還是更像他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Gla-dia。 你很強壯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歌蕾蒂婭冰冷地注視著獵物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"情緒。會有我們血親學習的。我們也在傳達許多，我們會試著傳達給你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"Ishar-mla。活著吧。活著會很好。下一次會有其他血親找到你......向你詢問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海嗣","speakerId":"avg_npc_186","isRemote":false,"text":"我們不太會問問題。我們會學會。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"慢慢地，海嗣低哼著蹲下去。\n怪物的軀體不再起伏。它蜷縮起來，像一朵迅速枯敗的花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——死了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂如釋重負。\n不，不能這麼說。她並沒有從真相中恢復過來。但這個獵物的死讓她感受到......\n它到底也只是個生物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你們這些孽種。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"主教提高了音量。零碎的聲響在他的喉頭，在激烈戰鬥留下的碎屑中爬行，像是他的聲帶正不住嘟囔。\n歌蕾蒂婭甚至沒去看他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，上前來。現在輪到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這隻垃圾孑然一身。外面那些恐魚也不是它這族的。那麼，只會是你的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我來把你們撕碎。我來讓你們褻瀆的行徑受罰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己來。是得在這裡把你們這些雜種都解決掉。生命可貴，但留你們的命是浪費資源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"一個重傷的孽種。一個動彈不得的孽種。我會把你們的殘渣抛灑在大地上，讓最低賤的陸地生物吃掉你們的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"殺死你們兩個，輕而易舉——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用再裝了。比起海嗣這些垃圾，還是你們這種曾經是人，現在又偽裝成人的最讓人反胃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"（嘶吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你們會死在這裡！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是不是把我忘了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斯卡蒂翻了個白眼。歌蕾蒂婭笑了笑。\n主教遲疑了一下，轉過頭去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
